    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "172b2218eb3fb815cdf0": "Once I welcomed darkness, for it was the sister of night. Now it is dark all the time, even during the day, and the forests cry out for sustenance. Unless we act soon, this spreading blight will cover the world.",
        "478f12ba64def1feb833": "Train me.",
        "c53703987eee13fae129": "Have you come here for instruction in the art of making potions? You were mistaken if you thought that I would offer such a privilege to you, unearned. Go, and do not return to me until you have greater skill.",
        "c7a05d8a4cbdabbe9e61": "Your skill displays an enduring affection for our art, but I would see further evidence of your commitment. I shall charge you with a task. Fulfill it, and I will be content."
      },
      "name": "Kylanna Windwhisper",
      "subName": "Master Alchemist",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
          "dialogue.172b2218eb3fb815cdf0": {
